  "fields": {
    "title": "Favicon",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "The favicon is a small image, which is displayed next to the ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7ui2yDTuWfqN28TIL0oE19",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "title",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " in a browser's title bar or a page's tab, like this:",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "embedded-asset-block",
          "data": {
            "target": {
              "sys": {
                "id": "3zKo1w9lFuCgGIkJYGwciL",
                "type": "Link",
                "linkType": "Asset"
              }
            }
          },
          "content": []
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "The favicon helps people to recognize a website, without the need to open it. The favicon is not only visible in the browser tab, but also in the bookmark list (favorites section). That's why you can compare the favicon (and the ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7ui2yDTuWfqN28TIL0oE19",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "title",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ") of a website to the spine of a book. Like standing in front of a bookshelf and looking for a specific book, the spine or the favicon can help you finding what you were looking for by having a recognizable design.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Background",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "The word favicon is based on the words ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "favorite",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " and ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "icon",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ". The favicon was first launched / introduced in 1999 by the computer company Microsoft in the Internet Explorer 5. ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Possibilities",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Today most browsers support not only light and dark mode, but also different themes to let users style their browser appearance. You should have that in mind while designing your favicon. Some people give their favicon an outline or a shadow to make sure it’s visible on different background colors. The favicon can also be animated. ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "codeField": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "value": "html\n<!-- this belongs inside the head tag -->\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/images/favicon.ico\">\n<!-- or -->\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": "document"
    },
    "codeComment": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Format",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-3"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "You can use the ico Format for your favicon, but you can also use classic image formats like png, jpeg or gif or vector formats like svg. When using png, jpeg or gif, make sure to have all different sizes included.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
